	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Qui has reddit, scribę nostri primi filius est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Indolem experitor Latine adfando.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Ludit suaviter praeter ętatem in testudine.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In his si mihi ipsum laudaveris, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>laudem mereberis apud patrem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Illum ergo tibi commendo, nonnisi ut familiariter <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum ipso agas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Nihil est praeterea novi, quod scribam, nisi quod <persName ref="p8041">Ioannes a Lasco</persName> per <placeName ref="l2472">Polonum</placeName> quendam nobilem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>salutem ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> misit ad me, id quod valde sum admiratus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Addidit religionem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ibi recte procedere per domini gratiam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ivit ipse <placeName ref="l522">Venetias</placeName> inde rediturus in <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>negocium evangelii regis favore et auxilia ac inprimis dei adgressurus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Dixit de rege suo multa bona, dein et magnam prudentiam, ex qua cum deo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>contra potentiam episcoporum suorum conatur evangelium instituere paulatim.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">idem de <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Cęsare narravit dixisse quatuor esse per <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>, qui morarentur Interim <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>suum: <persName ref="p2095">Philippum</persName>, <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName>, <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName> et <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego vero: "Reliquos non novit, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>forsitan et hos aliquando cognoscet, si vixerit."</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si vixerit, dico; nam consenti<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>unt fere mathematici diem Mathię esse debere illi vitę ultimum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Equidem vellem nosse de <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensibus</placeName> certo, quę circumferuntur, dira.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Audieram <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te huc quędam misisse, verum ad me non pervenerunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Vellem autem ob hoc, ut <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>magis principum tantorum fides cognosceretur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Bone deus, qualia monstra vel <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>specie tenus, ut taceam de animis monstrosissimis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Sed desino lassus adhuc sorpore <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et animo; dominus, si placuerit, restituat me.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p8011">Gualthero</persName> et <persName ref="p8459">Otone</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 27. Februarii anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myc[onius]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heniricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro praestantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> pręsuli, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratri in domino venerando <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
